## Goal Description

> [!CAUTION]
> **ABSOLUTE ZERO TOLERANCE — NO EXEMPTIONS, NO ALLOWLISTS, NO EXCEPTIONS.**

Perform an exhaustive, holistic, root-cause structural remediation of the Quorum backend (`backend_v2`) across **ALL 74 affected files** to permanently eliminate ALL permissive typing bypasses and soft shortcuts with zero remaining technical debt:

1. **Zero `dict[str, Any]` and naked dictionaries in state transit** — ALL intermediate state dictionaries, message lists (`list[dict[str, Any]]`), and loose metadata dicts replaced 100% with strongly typed Pydantic V2 DTOs (`LLMMessageDTO`, `TaskMetadataDTO`, `GlobalContextVarsDTO`).
2. **Zero `isinstance(..., dict)` duck-typing** — ALL **193 instances** eliminated (**136 QGR-suppressed + 57 unsuppressed**) across **59 files**. No fault domain exemptions (including Repository, Driver, Model, and Util layers).
3. **Zero `# noqa: QGR` suppressions** — ALL **169 suppressions** removed (**136 QGR012, 7 QGR002, 7 QGR001, 18 QGR003, 1 QGR007**). No inline suppressions remain anywhere.
4. **Zero `match/case dict` and `case {'id': ...}` duck-tape** — ALL **7 instances** across 4 files eliminated.
5. **Zero QGR violations** — `uv run python scripts/_ast_guardrails.py backend_v2 --strict` passes with ZERO violations and FATAL enforcement across all non-test files.
6. **Zero `cast(Any, ...)` bypasses** — ALL **5 instances** refactored into strictly typed structures.
7. **Zero `extra="ignore"` / Token Shield bypasses** — 100% of models enforce `ConfigDict(extra="forbid", strict=True)` with zero exceptions.

